## Mandatory Sync After Editing CLI/Shared

When you edit files in `DynamicsCrm.DevKit.Cli` or `DynamicsCrm.DevKit.Shared`, you **MUST** run:

```powershell
cd DynamicsCrm.DevKit.Tests\TestClientCode
.\03.Generate-All.ps1
.\04.Sync-All.ps1
```

