## Test Scope Rules

| Keyword | Work On |
|---------|---------|
| `UnitTest` (or `test`) | Only `-UnitTest` folders |
| `AICode` (or `ai`) | Only `-AICode` folders |
| `Vsix` (or `vsix`) | Only `-Vsix` folders |
| `js` | Only JS folders (01, 03, 05) |
| `ts` | Only TS folders (02, 04, 06) |
| _(no keyword)_ | All 6 folders, both JS and TS |

---

## Bug Fix Workflow

1. Identify the bug and root cause
2. Fix in the **Source of Truth** file (not in synced copies)
3. Run `03.Generate-All.ps1` and `04.Sync-All.ps1`
4. Re-test with `npm test` or `npm run check`

---

## TestClientCode Workflows

| Workflow | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `/client-code-clean` | Clean all 6 TestClientCode folders |
| `/client-code-install` | Install NPM packages for all 6 folders |
| `/client-code-generate` | Generate entity files via CLI |
| `/client-code-sync` | Sync source-of-truth files to all folders |
| `/client-code-test` | Run checks, builds, and tests for all projects |
| `/run-cli` | Run a specific CLI profile (JS-FORM, JS-WEBAPI, TS-FORM, TS-WEBAPI) |
